                                "sense_id": "47600307-26c7-33b9-a8ab-b4df278bf29e",
                                "text": "Het Schotse hoogland staat bekend om zijn ruige schoonheid.",
                                "translation": "The Scottish highland is known for its rugged beauty.",
                                "english": "The Scottish highland is known for its rugged beauty."
                            },
